        pic: { sky: 'dusk', ground: 'grass', props: [['castle', 0.84, 0.6, 0.8, { arms: 'lancaster' }], ['tent', 0.14, 0.7, 1.05, { col: HYW_RED }], ['tent', 0.36, 0.66, 0.9, { col: HYW_BLUE }], ['fire', 0.26, 0.82, 0.9]], troops: [['sword', 'blue', 0.44, 0.92, 38, 'idle', -1, 'side', 0.6], ['hero_derby', 'blue', 0.58, 0.86, 44, 'idle', -1, 'side', 0, 'hero'], ['longbow', 'blue', 0.72, 0.9, 38, 'idle', -1, 'side', 0.3]] },
        text: 'Caught by surprise, the French camp collapsed into panic. Louis of Poitiers was mortally wounded, and many French lords were captured and ransomed, which made Derby rich. It was a small battle, but it showed what a few bold men could do.',
