        text: 'Only Gerard and two of his knights escaped, all of them wounded. Roger de Moulins, Master of the Hospital, died with his men. Our riders crossed back over the Jordan that evening, as the truce required. Shamed, Count Raymond made peace with King Guy: now the whole kingdom would march against us together.',
