        text: 'The Franks scattered to plunder our camp, and the Sultan fell on them with his reserves while the garrison of Acre attacked them from behind. Gerard de Ridefort, who had escaped at Cresson, was killed. But the Franks held on to their siege lines, and more crusaders kept coming by sea.',
