      heroBox: { title: 'Sultan and brother', text: 'Saladin heals and steadies the troops near him; al-Adil gives your riders fresh horses.' },
      twistTitle: "The Lionheart's stand", twistText: 'Richard is the toughest commander of all. Kneeling spearmen hurt your riders, and his crossbowmen shoot in pairs, faster. At 0:35 al-Adil sends Richard two horses.',
