        text: 'Joan came back with her banner, and when it touched the earthwork our men poured over. "Glasdale, yield to the King of Heaven!" she cried. The English fled across the drawbridge, but a burning boat had been set under it, and it broke. Glasdale fell into the Loire and drowned.',
