      hero: 'joan', commander: 'luxembourg', twist: 'sortie', blueCount: 'A few hundred men', redCount: 'Burgundians and English from three camps', heroRole: 'Hero · the Maid', commanderRole: 'Commander · arrives at 0:15',
      twistTitle: 'The sortie', twistText: 'The Burgundian post at Margny is caught napping. At 0:15 Luxembourg rides in on your left, at 0:30 the English on your right. At 0:50 the gate shuts behind you.',
